  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-defense art direction: disciplined near-black palette, crisp white hierarchy, restrained cyan/red accents, and consistent mono labels. Desktop composition feels polished, but the atlas grid visibly clips its leftmost card content. Tablet/mobile adapt coherently, yet become very tall and dense; the raw JSON is horizontally truncated, and the header feels cramped with partially hidden navigation and faint underlying text showing through. Small low-contrast labels also weaken legibility.",
